<title>USA: Figure skating-Tuesday's results at U.S. nationals</title>
<headline>Figure skating-Tuesday's results at U.S. nationals</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tennessee 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results after two compulsory dances at the U.S. National Figure Skating Championships on Tuesday:</p>
<p>1. Elizabeth Punsalan and Jerod Swallow, .4 factored placement</p>
<p>2. Eve Chalom and Mathew Gates, .8</p>
<p>3. Kate Robinson and Peter Breen, 1.4</p>
<p>4. Naomi Lang and Peter Tchernyshev, 1.6</p>
<p>5. Amy Webster and Ron Kravette, 1.8</p>
<p>6. Deborah Koegel and Oleg Fediukov, 2.4</p>
<p>7. Cheryl Demkowski and Gregory Maddelone, 2.8</p>
<p>8. Margot Condis and Robert Peal, 3.4</p>
<p>=equal Tami Tyler and Jonathan Tyler, 3.4</p>
<p>10. Julia Bikbova and James Swanson, 4.4</p>
<p>=equal Beata Handra and Charles Sinek, 4.4</p>
